    70	
    71	One judge request is `one boundary × all unique tuned candidates/reasons`. Opus and Sol independently see blind mechanics, the selected rubric/materiality, and no teacher/tuning identity, engine ordering, rollout, or other judge. Store legality, rubric quality, pairwise preference, confidence, and WHY consistency separately. They are auxiliary targets/hard-example flags, never primary labels or hidden weights. Both columns are required for release.
