    46	- None-dominant primary, including `2/2/1`: retain soft primary; omit fallback with `primary_condition_unresolved`.
    47	- Zero/one eligible alternatives: emit no learning row and record `no_eligible_alternative`/`single_eligible_alternative`; deterministic controller behavior is metadata.
